269
00:18:29,260 --> 00:18:34,260
学生一:安静,大家安静…"爱因斯坦教授"要讲课了.
Student 1: Chill, chill everybody...Professor Einstein is talking.

270
00:18:35,600 --> 00:18:37,160
学生二:你今天打算教我们点什么?是关于太阳好像真地,
Student 2: What are you going to teach us today?

271
00:18:37,320 --> 00:18:39,220
真地很热吗?
The sun is like really really hot?

272
00:18:40,840 --> 00:18:44,680
迈克:不,今天我们要继续探讨引力的问题.
Mike: No, today we are going to continue the discussion on gravity.

273
00:18:45,960 --> 00:18:47,760
好了,我们要把这个问题搞懂,即使这要花一整天的时间.
Ok, now we are going to get this right, if it takes all day.

274
00:18:47,920 --> 00:18:49,300
学生二:我最好数着日历本.
Student 2: I better clear my calendar.

275
00:18:49,300 --> 00:18:59,300
迈克:听好了.不论质量大小,地球引力对一切物体都施加不变而同等的力.
Mike: Ok, the earth's gravity exerts a constant and equal force on all objects, regardless of mass.

276
00:19:03,340 --> 00:19:09,380
比如,一根羽毛和一枚硬币必定以完全相等的速度降落.
For example, a feather and a coin, must fall at exactly the same speed.

277
00:19:14,300 --> 00:19:14,600
一旦去掉空气阻力的因素…空气阻力!!!
Once the factor of air resistance is removed....

278
00:19:14,600 --> 00:19:20,500
嗨!别动.那是一个水气球吗?
Air resistance!!!Hey!Hold it right there.Is that a water balloon?

279
00:19:20,500 --> 00:19:23,000
学生:是的,老师.
Student: Yes, yes sir.

280
00:19:26,900 --> 00:19:33,800
迈克:有创意.很好…谁还有这玩意?同学们,同学们,昨天我们没有考虑空气阻力的因素.
Mike: Good thinking.All right...has anybody else got one?Guys, guys, guys, yesterday we didn't account for the air resistance.

281
00:19:33,800 --> 00:19:35,100
卢克:什么?
Luke: What?

282
00:19:35,100 --> 00:19:45,300
迈克:好,大家跟我来.我们来把气球扔到窗外去.好,大家看好了:一个重气球,一个轻气球.
Mike: Ok, everybody follow me.We are going to throw them out the window.Ok, everyone observe: A heavy balloon, and a light balloon.

283
00:19:45,300 --> 00:19:53,800
好,卢克,你来计算时间.
Ok, Luke, I want you to time this.

284
00:19:53,800 --> 00:19:55,000
卢克:2点2秒.
Luke: 2.2 seconds.

285
00:19:55,000 --> 00:19:58,000
学生:两个气球同时掉到猫身上…
Student: That cold cocked that cat at the same time...

286
00:19:58,000 --> 00:19:59,300
迈克:那好,这说明什么?
Mike: Ok, now what does that mean?

287
00:19:59,300 --> 00:20:01,800
卢克:说明猫被打晕了?
Luke: The cat is unconscious?

288
00:20:06,140 --> 00:20:11,200
迈克:不,
Mike: No, it means that whatever we drop will take 2.2 seconds to hit

289
00:20:11,200 --> 00:20:11,640
这说明不论我们扔什么都会花2点2秒时间达到地面.
the ground.

290
00:20:12,360 --> 00:20:13,680
卢克:我们还扔什么?
Luke: What else can we drop?

291
00:20:14,600 --> 00:20:15,460
学生:新年帽子.
Student: New year's hat.

292
00:20:19,820 --> 00:20:22,080
卢克:还是2点2秒.我们扔大一点的东西…
Luke: 2.2 seconds, let's try something bigger...

293
00:20:22,080 --> 00:20:22,180
学生三:对了,特德的午饭.
Student 3: Yeah, T.D's lunch.

294
00:20:22,180 --> 00:20:24,500
学生二:嘿,那是我妈妈做的!!!
Student 2: Hey my mom packed that!!!

295
00:20:24,500 --> 00:20:26,200
卢克:2点2秒.
Luke: 2.2 seconds.

296
00:20:26,200 --> 00:20:29,100
学生一:我们也做了一个漂亮的实验.
Student 1: We made a pretty cool design too.

297
00:20:33,080 --> 00:20:35,000
卢克:但羽毛就不会那么快地落下去.
Luke: But there's no way feathers are going to drop that fast...

298
00:20:35,560 --> 00:20:35,600
迈克:但羽毛的问题在于空气阻力.
Mike: But the problem with the feather is that air resistance.

299
00:20:35,600 --> 00:20:46,000
好了,也许课本里就有答案…我们继续实验.
Ok, now, maybe the book has more to say...ok come on.

300
00:20:46,000 --> 00:20:49,500
卢克:这里有个真空管,跟图上的一样.
Luke: There's a picture in there of a tube, just like this one.

301
00:21:04,720 --> 00:21:09,040
迈克:好…好了…可以了.硬币,羽毛,没有空气.
Mike: Ok...allright...here we go.Coin, feather, no air.

302
00:21:09,720 --> 00:21:19,860
我们要展示真理.屏住呼吸,注意观察.成功了!!!
Moment of truth, watch and be amazed.It worked!!!

303
00:21:20,140 --> 00:21:21,460
卢克:太棒了,再做一次!
Luke: That was great, do that again!

304
00:21:21,460 --> 00:21:21,560
迈克:好,好的.
Mike: Ok ok.

305
00:21:25,300 --> 00:21:26,360
卢克:这太神奇了,
Luke: This is amazing, this is incredible...

306
00:21:26,900 --> 00:21:28,960
太不可思议了…你不像大家说的那么笨啊.
you're not as stupid as everyone says you are.

307
00:21:28,960 --> 00:21:29,060
迈克:我不笨,我不笨.
Mike: I'm not, I'm not.

308
00:21:29,060 --> 00:21:29,100
卢克:我们要像这样学更多的知识.
Luke: Hey we got to do more stuff like this.

309
00:21:33,180 --> 00:21:35,420
迈克:你说对了.我们有整本书要学呢,
Mike: Oh yeah you bet, we got a whole book to go through here,

310
00:21:35,460 --> 00:21:36,320
而我们才学到了…第几页?
and we are only on page what...?

311
00:21:36,320 --> 00:21:36,420
卢克:第一页.
Luke: One.

312
00:21:38,800 --> 00:21:50,640
迈克:那好,下面…下面…哦,我得跟泰德斯科先生谈谈去…呃,继续上课.泰德斯科先生!!!
Mike: Ok, now next time...next time...I got to talk to Tedesco...Uh, carry

313
00:21:50,640 --> 00:21:51,260
on.Mr.Tedesco

314
00:21:58,560 --> 00:22:01,600
弗兰西斯:啊,西沃先生,我刚刚把你的解聘书给寄出去.你解脱了.
Francis: Ah Mr.Seaver I just mailed in your termination packet downtown, you are free

315
00:22:02,060 --> 00:22:03,540
迈克:泰德斯科先生,我们得谈谈.
Mike: Mr.Tedesco we have to talk.

316
00:22:04,180 --> 00:22:05,020
弗兰西斯:谈什么?
Francis: About what?

317
00:22:05,020 --> 00:22:11,800
迈克:我说了你会笑话我的,但"傻瓜老师"要坚持教下去了.
学生一:2点2秒!
00:22:11,800
Mike: Well, you're going to laugh, but the teaching fool is here to stay. Student 1: 2.2 seconds!
